<title>CHINA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of the</p>
<p>13th round of China's soccer league on Sunday:</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	4    Guangdong Hongyuan  1</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua    3    Sichuan Quanxing    1</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	 1    Guangzhou Apollo    0</p>
<p> Vanguards Huandao   3    Tianjin Samsung     1</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	1    August First	  1</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodon	 2    Dalian Wanda	  2</p>
</text>
